{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31376","headline":"和于中丞登越王楼作 · 卢栯","name":"和于中丞登越王楼作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"图[画]越王楼，开缄慰别愁。\n山光涵雪冷，水色带江秋。\n云岛孤征鴈，烟帆一叶舟。\n向风舒霁景，如伴谢公游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢栯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}